---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Pest Control Resources & Tips | Zero Pest Control"
description: "Prevention tips and pest control resources for homeowners, landlords, property managers, and businesses across Sudbury and Northern Ontario."
permalink: /blog-resources/
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Blog &amp; Resources</p>
    <h1>Pest Control Resources</h1>
    <p class="lede">Helpful pest prevention tips for homeowners, landlords, property managers, and businesses across Sudbury and Northern Ontario.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Prevention Guides</p>
      <h2>Pest-by-Pest Prevention Tips</h2>
      <p>Each service page includes a full breakdown of where a pest comes from, what attracts it, and what you can do at home to prevent it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid--4">
      {% for item in collections.services %}
      <a class="card reveal text-center" href="{{ item.url }}">
        <div class="icon-badge" style="margin-inline:auto;">{{ icon(item.data.pestIcon or "bug") }}</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem; margin-top:0.8rem;">{{ item.data.pestName or item.data.title }}</h3>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Pest Identification</p>
      <h2>Not Sure What You're Dealing With?</h2>
      <p>Browse our Pest Library to compare appearance, habitat, and risk for common Ontario pests.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/pest-library/">Visit the Pest Library {{ icon("arrow-right") }}</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid--2">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="icon-badge">{{ icon("home") }}</div>
        <h3>For Homeowners</h3>
        <p>Seasonal pest patterns, DIY prevention steps, and when it's time to call a professional.</p>
        <a class="card-link" href="/residential/">Residential Pest Control {{ icon("arrow-right") }}</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal">
        <div class="icon-badge">{{ icon("building") }}</div>
        <h3>For Landlords & Businesses</h3>
        <p>Compliance-focused guidance for property managers, restaurants, retail, and more.</p>
        <a class="card-link" href="/commercial/">Commercial Pest Control {{ icon("arrow-right") }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-banner reveal">
      <div>
        <h2>Have a Question We Haven't Answered?</h2>
        <p>Get in touch and we'll help you figure out what's going on and what to do next.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-banner-actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Contact Us</a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline-invert" href="/faq/">Read the FAQ</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
